### TITLE ###
no name is a usage error
### DESCRIPTION ###
Exit 2 rather than 1: nothing went wrong at runtime, the invocation was wrong.
### ARGS ###
--shout
### STDERR ###
greet: no name given
### EXIT ###
2

### TITLE ###
unknown flag names the flag
### ARGS ###
--yell
Ada
### STDERR ###
greet: unknown flag --yell
### EXIT ###
2

### TITLE ###
repeat rejects a non-number
### ARGS ###
--repeat
lots
Ada
### STDERR ###
greet: --repeat wants a positive number, got "lots"
### EXIT ###
2

### TITLE ###
repeat rejects a missing count
### ARGS ###
Ada
--repeat
### STDERR ###
greet: --repeat needs a count
### EXIT ###
2

### TITLE ###
an unknown locale fails before any greeting
### FIXTURE ###
klingon
### ARGS ###
Ada
### STDERR ###
greet: unknown locale "tlh"
### EXIT ###
2
